00:32:13.700 --> 00:32:21.920
<v Keith Lucas>I believe strongly that the person with the performance issue must drive their own turnaround.

329
00:32:22.240 --> 00:32:26.480
<v Keith Lucas>Ownership is often at the heart of performance issue.

330
00:32:26.480 --> 00:32:31.320
<v Keith Lucas>issue. Either they're not owning something explicitly or they're not owning their performance

331
00:32:31.320 --> 00:32:38.160
<v Keith Lucas>intentionally. And so ownership is usually at the heart of performance issues. So it has to be at

