00:33:54.580 --> 00:34:00.960
<v Keith Lucas>So I think it's all not ownership oriented and too constricting on the outcome.

352
00:34:01.260 --> 00:34:07.680
<v Keith Lucas>So what I recommend in SPIN, and this is, again, going with my coaching out philosophy,

353
00:34:07.980 --> 00:34:13.820
