362
00:35:05.360 --> 00:35:28.320
<v Keith Lucas>And then you stop. You don't go any further. You allow that person to take ownership of their situation and turn it around. And when I've done this in practice, the people who have turned around have gone on to be amazing contributors. And so much so that when I'm reminded years later that they had this, I'm surprised.

363
00:35:28.320 --> 00:35:40.640
<v Keith Lucas>I'm like, really? We had an orange talk with you? I'm completely surprised because we led with ownership and information and allowed them to manage themselves.

